{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Heterogeneous Architecture Styles"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear and use to talk about heterogeneous architecture styles."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Build the application installation program, using IT development tools available in the market, based on solution architecture features.  Recognizes and implements the different types of architecture styles that can be included in the IT solution."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level. Exchanges simple information on the hardware devices and the architecture of a system to create the IT solution."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n6le01ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Present Perfect - Affirmative Form"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>You use <strong>the present perfect tense</strong>to talk about actions that took place in the past and they still happen in the present.</p>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have developed the necessary skills to work with architecture styles."}, {"type": "example", "content": "They have helped more communication software to appear."}, {"type": "example", "content": "It has contributed to most application designers to implement their software."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Whenever we use <strong>the present perfect tense</strong> in affirmative sentences<strong>, </strong>we are usually talking about experiences or relevant actions from the past that continue in the present. We use <strong>have</strong> (<strong>has</strong> for the 3<sup>rd</sup> person) as an auxiliary and the following verb goes in <strong>past participle.</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p> <p>Let&rsquo;s review the grammatical structure:&nbsp;</p> <p style=\"text-align: center;\">Subject + <strong>have/has</strong> + <strong>verb in past participle</strong> + complement&nbsp;</p> <p>Examples:<span class=\"italic\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li><span class=\"italic\">Heterogeneous styles <strong>have changed</strong> the ways of structuring processes in a system.</span></li> <li><span class=\"italic\">The table driven style <strong>has included</strong> a system for self-interpreting.</span></li>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Table Driven and Heterogeneous Architecture Styles"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "The <strong>table driven architecture style </strong>is known for applying virtual machines for interpreting, and the <strong>heterogeneous architecture style </strong>is able to combine a series of methods for a more complete approach."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Table driven interpreters are used to build virtual machines. They include an interpretation engine and a pseudo-program which is interpreted by the engine."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<p><strong>Table driven architecture: </strong>By using interpreters virtual machines are built to connect the semantics of the program to the engine.</p> <p><strong>Heterogeneous architecture: </strong>Instead of being an individual pure method to structure processes, this style of architecture offers the combination of different styles by using hierarchy.</p> <p>In the next chart we will be able to see the main concepts of these two styles.</p>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "A mixture of architectural connectors is used to combine different styles to improve power, efficiency, performance, programmability, and portability."}, {"type": "image", "content": "enpe8n6le01ob09img01.jpg"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "heterogeneous "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "made of different parts"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Describe to me the heterogeneous architecture style."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le01ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pseudo-"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "almost similar to the referent"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They include an interpretation engine and a pseudo-program which is interpreted by the engine."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le01ob09aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "set "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a group of items"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This style implements more than one set of instructions where there's only one memory."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le01ob09aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "broad "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "that is wide"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We're looking for someone with a broad knowledge about certain architecture styles."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le01ob09aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "simplify "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to do things easier to do"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This style has been growing to simplify processes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le01ob09aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mixture "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a combination of things unified "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A mixture of architectural connectors is used to combine different styles."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n6le01ob09aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for information about other familiar architecture styles."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Take notes about those styles."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Write a description for each familiar architecture style."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a chart to compare the different architecture styles you have found."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Show your chart to your teacher. "}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I search information about other familiar architecture styles."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a description for each familiar architecture style."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make a chart to compare the other familiar architecture styles."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share the information with my class."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"time": "100", "image": "enpe8n6le01ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Martin:</span> We're looking for someone with a broad knowledge about certain architecture styles. Do you consider yourself an expert on this matter? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Samantha:</span> Definitely, I have been designing programs for three years and I have developed the necessary skills to work with architecture styles. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Martin:</span> Excellent. Can you talk to me about the table driven interpreters? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Samantha:</span> Table driven interpreters are used to build virtual machines. They include an interpretation engine and a pseudo-program which is interpreted by the engine. Such engine includes a definition of the interpretation and the current state of the process. This style has four components which are the interpretation engine, a memory, a representation of the interpretation, and another representation of the current state of the program."}, {"time": "54000", "image": "enpe8n6le01ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Martin:</span> Good, now can you explain to me other familiar architecture styles? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Samantha:</span> Well, there are different types, some are commonly used and some others are very particular. For instance, distributed processes. They have been facilitating inter-process protocols and they have helped more communication software to appear. Another example is main programs/subroutine organizations that mirror the language in which the system was written and the subroutines provide control. We also have domain-specific software architectures to obtain references and state transition and process control systems to move among systems and control them."}, {"time": "101500", "image": "enpe8n6le01ob09re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Martin:</span> Terrific! Finally, describe to me the heterogeneous architecture style. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Samantha:</span> This style implements more than one set of instructions where there's only one memory. A mixture of architectural connectors is used to combine different styles to improve power, efficiency, performance, programmability, and portability. The idea is to organize the components by hierarchy. This style has been growing to simplify processes as it has contributed to most application designers to implement their software. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Martin:</span> You're hired!"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n6le01ob09re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "enp